description: Android unit and instrumented test conventions
globs: **/*Test.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- ViewModel tests: `runTest`, `StandardTestDispatcher`, `Dispatchers.setMain` / `resetMain`
- Repository tests: `Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder` (instrumented) or fake DAO
- Prefer testing behavior over implementation details
- Compose UI tests only when interaction logic warrants it
- Pure utils (`MoneyFormatter`, `DateFormatter`): JVM unit tests in `src/test/`

Run: `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`
